The `CloseableHttpClient` class has moved from `org.apache.http.impl.client` to `org.apache.hc.client5.http.impl.classic` in HttpClient 5.x. Update your import to `org.apache.hc.client5.http.impl.classic.CloseableHttpClient`.

```java
// Before
import org.apache.http.impl.client.CloseableHttpClient;

// After
import org.apache.hc.client5.http.impl.classic.CloseableHttpClient;
```

The `HttpClients` builder class has moved from `org.apache.http.impl.client` to `org.apache.hc.client5.http.impl.classic` in HttpClient 5.x. Update your import to `org.apache.hc.client5.http.impl.classic.HttpClients`.

```java
// Before
import org.apache.http.impl.client.HttpClients;

// After
import org.apache.hc.client5.http.impl.classic.HttpClients;
```

The `SSLConnectionSocketFactory` class has moved from `org.apache.http.conn.ssl` to `org.apache.hc.client5.http.ssl` in HttpClient 5.x. Consider using `HttpClientConnectionManagerBuilder` with TLS configuration for the 5.x approach.

```java
// Before
import org.apache.http.conn.ssl.SSLConnectionSocketFactory;

// After
import org.apache.hc.client5.http.ssl.SSLConnectionSocketFactory;
```

The `SSLContexts` utility class has moved from `org.apache.http.ssl` to `org.apache.hc.core5.ssl` in HttpClient 5.x. Update your import accordingly.

```java
// Before
import org.apache.http.ssl.SSLContexts;

// After
import org.apache.hc.core5.ssl.SSLContexts;
```

The `RequestConfig` class has moved from `org.apache.http.client.config` to `org.apache.hc.client5.http.config` in HttpClient 5.x. Additionally, `setConnectTimeout(int)` and `setSocketTimeout(int)` now accept `Timeout` objects instead of raw milliseconds.

```java
// Before
import org.apache.http.client.config.RequestConfig;
RequestConfig.custom()
    .setConnectTimeout(60000)
    .setSocketTimeout(60000)
    .build();

// After
import org.apache.hc.client5.http.config.RequestConfig;
import org.apache.hc.core5.util.Timeout;
RequestConfig.custom()
    .setConnectTimeout(Timeout.ofSeconds(60))
    .setResponseTimeout(Timeout.ofSeconds(60))
    .build();
```

The `SocketConfig` class has moved from `org.apache.http.config` to `org.apache.hc.core5.http.io` in HttpClient 5.x. The `setSoTimeout(int)` method now accepts a `Timeout` object.

```java
// Before
import org.apache.http.config.SocketConfig;
SocketConfig.custom().setSoTimeout(60000).build();

// After
import org.apache.hc.core5.http.io.SocketConfig;
import org.apache.hc.core5.util.Timeout;
SocketConfig.custom().setSoTimeout(Timeout.ofSeconds(60)).build();
```

The `CookieSpecs` constants class from `org.apache.http.client.config` has been replaced by `StandardCookieSpec` in `org.apache.hc.client5.http.cookie` in HttpClient 5.x.

```java
// Before
import org.apache.http.client.config.CookieSpecs;
.setCookieSpec(CookieSpecs.STANDARD_STRICT)

// After
import org.apache.hc.client5.http.cookie.StandardCookieSpec;
.setCookieSpec(StandardCookieSpec.STRICT)
```

