```

The `getStatusLine()` method has been removed from `HttpResponse` in HttpClient 5.x. Use `getCode()` to get the HTTP status code and `getReasonPhrase()` to get the reason phrase.

```java
// Before
if (response.getStatusLine().getStatusCode() >= 300) {
    throw new ClientProtocolException(Objects.toString(response.getStatusLine()));
}

// After
if (response.getCode() >= 300) {
    throw new ClientProtocolException(response.getReasonPhrase());
}
```

